   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adjectives are verbs",
     "texto": [
      "In Korean, «big», «small» and «good» work as **verbs**: they already contain the meaning of «to be».",
      "**집이 커요** = the house is big. Nothing else is needed: 커요 means «is big».",
      "The thing you are talking about takes **이** or **가**: 방**이** 작아요 (the room is small), 나무**가** 많아요 (there are many trees)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
